{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1000_p", "source_sha256": "169dd642949cb184ffd47333872b0757f2a352c5bc7eef9ed18ce99787b4b95b", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日だ。\n桃子のテーマは『少女と動物』なのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的日子。桃子的主题是《少女与动物》，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "4ce881f90b1045755e3bcd939ee5d824c482ebab09caaedcf98b43705d30c623", "ja": "んー……。あのウシさんはちょっと臆病なのかな？\nでも、あっちの子は元気いっぱいだから……。", "zh": "嗯——……那头牛是不是有点胆小呢？\n不过，那边的孩子很有活力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1002_p", "source_sha256": "48f1475ae601016ea5fb9c2cfb28b272629c5ea49c27dba55ec6ed4bae8f0fbc", "ja": "桃子、お疲れさま。\n真剣な顔して、何してるんだ？", "zh": "桃子，辛苦了。\n一脸认真地在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "0f1815bef2eb091de3b6fdcaa1cabf30471e76488cc67a6894b447a12243297b", "ja": "もう、見て分からない？　撮影の準備だよ。\n共演者がどんな子たちか、確認してたの。", "zh": "真是的，看不出来吗？我在准备拍摄啊。\n我刚才在确认要一起出演的孩子们都是怎样的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "c57858713e7d2f4de3facc763b59177e2e30f15e1ed434c84e8ad959c46176a8", "ja": "一緒にお仕事する相手のことは知っておかないと。\n動物たちにも失礼でしょ？", "zh": "总得先了解一下要一起工作的对象吧。\n不然对动物们也太失礼了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1005_p", "source_sha256": "45d5638934fcf393a52d5aa9d2b2730822d7b0d5d01c73b5992e11d74712d5be", "ja": "なるほど、それで真剣に見てたのか。\nそこまで考えていたなんて、さすが桃子だな！", "zh": "原来如此，所以才会看得那么认真啊。\n居然考虑得这么周到，不愧是桃子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "51270e2a582c285eac8841b2b887e8648dc006a5f3e957be0d8f3939c6bdaf63", "ja": "これぐらいプロなら常識だよ！\nむしろ、お兄ちゃんはプロとして……。", "zh": "这点常识，作为专业人士当然是必须的！\n倒是哥哥你，作为专业人士……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1007_null", "source_sha256": "5126b134e55d1825ea1725157bde72b2ccd0925cacd2d4deade3c157051b73b9", "ja": "メェェ～。", "zh": "咩——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "c19352422b1908ac0c84a982ae2320cf6c456386e8795acc77955707d3920ab8", "ja": "あっ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f69537269d4ba485d3ba9da5b51b537a5def1aa5282799ac41921377992ae1cc", "ja": "いまの鳴き声は……ヤギかな？\nっと、ごめんごめん。話の途中だったな。", "zh": "刚才的叫声是……山羊吗？\n哎呀，抱歉抱歉。刚才话才说到一半呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "367540f3fd1932e7910b26c8defd1f68ac2369cf7082cbc50884b6885332cdfb", "ja": "あ、うん……えっと、だから。お兄ちゃんは\nもう少しプロ意識を持ったほうが……。", "zh": "啊，嗯……那个，所以说。哥哥你还是应该再有点职业意识……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1011_goat", "source_sha256": "826a3de3aca5a3548f09b59f05d05c4081145e60f0c617bf29c26db4ea2a1d54", "ja": "メエェェェ～。", "zh": "咩咩咩～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "00aca8f04b68ddf6eaa0752eb39a40c187b395b9ee123f9458689ba1af22d4ae", "ja": "う～っ。だ、だから桃子は……。", "zh": "唔～。所、所以桃子才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1013_p", "source_sha256": "270ca49bc33c0a8fbb342e057a8601c548514927922b0581220c494f6c275411", "ja": "……ヤギ、気になるのか？", "zh": "……很在意山羊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "7a0b0ffe902c3648e3fbaf29ac3f0afe99ceb0e0090dc561388db961850917a1", "ja": "お、お兄ちゃん！\n桃子はね、芸能界の常識を教えてるんだよ？", "zh": "哥、哥哥！\n桃子是在教你演艺圈的常识哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fa38961ab12e79f7f0cde1215ed5bed83c57bb7962fd3081c8e0acf8abc2d495", "ja": "ああ。それについては勉強しておくよ。ところで……\n本番まで時間があるけど、桃子はどうする？", "zh": "嗯。关于那件事，我会先好好了解一下。不过……\n离正式演出还有些时间，桃子打算做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1016_049mom", "source_sha256": "fea8fac9bbf91638b2ece3cf630437013040fe7117021466ffbea1415a23179d", "ja": "えっ？　……ふーん、そうなんだ。\nちょっと桃子、ヤギさんに挨拶してこようかな。", "zh": "咦？……嗯——原来是这样啊。\n桃子要不要去跟山羊先生打个招呼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "2c9a2c34d7d795c901b0a1ccb38e2fedf094ecb830f31dc08db57a066bb73078", "ja": "あ、もちろんお仕事のためだよ！　プロとして\n挨拶は大事なんだから。それじゃ行ってくるね！", "zh": "啊，当然是为了工作啦！作为专业人士，打招呼可是很重要的。那我先过去啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0423_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0423_1018_p", "source_sha256": "806f9533aae4f9e05168582ab79ff64a81939327207aa459821674a83c4be143", "ja": "（桃子は楽しそうにヤギと仲良くなった。その後の\n撮影もバッチリ。少女と動物の自然な一枚が撮れた！）", "zh": "（桃子开心地和山羊熟悉了起来。之后的拍摄也非常顺利。成功拍到了少女与动物自然相处的画面！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
